9,Austronesian Soundscapes,https://www.cambridge.org/core/books/austronesian-soundscapes/8B714F18DC010F5F8E4997353C4B18BA,"Drawing together contemporary cultural studies and musical analysis, Austronesian Soundscapes will fill this research gap, offering a comprehensive analysis of traditional and contemporary Austronesian music and, at the same time, investigating how music reflects the challenges that Austronesian cultures face in this age of globalization.",Talise,Austronesian
